self-hosted-email — mail server management

  email add <user@domain>          create a mailbox (prompts for password
                                    and, optionally, a display name)
  email del <user@domain>          remove a mailbox and its mail
  email list                       list mailboxes + disk usage + display name
  email password <user@domain>     change a mailbox's password
  email display-name <addr> "Name" set/change the guaranteed display name
                                    (alias: email edit)
  email alias-add <alias> <target> forward alias@domain -> target@domain
  email alias-del <alias> <target> remove that forward
  email alias-list                 list all aliases
  email dkim                       (re)generate the DKIM signing key
  email queue                      show mail stuck in the outbound queue
  email status                     docker compose ps for the mail stack
  email logs                       tail the mail server's logs
  email restart                    restart the mail container
  email -h                         show this help
